{"type":"standard","title":"Siuslaw language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Siuslaw language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q2315424","titles":{"canonical":"Siuslaw_language","normalized":"Siuslaw language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Siuslaw language</span></span>"},"pageid":17002670,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Siuslaw_lang.png/330px-Siuslaw_lang.png","width":330,"height":366},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/Siuslaw_lang.png","width":533,"height":591},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1330692494","tid":"96baf346-e766-11f0-880c-23dc2d8fe265","timestamp":"2026-01-01T23:07:05Z","description":"Extinct Native American language formerly spoken in Oregon","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siuslaw_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siuslaw_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siuslaw_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Siuslaw_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siuslaw_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Siuslaw_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siuslaw_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Siuslaw_language"}},"extract":"Siuslaw was the language of the Siuslaw people and Lower Umpqua (Kuitsh) people of Oregon. It is also known as Lower Umpqua. The Siuslaw language had two dialects: Siuslaw proper (Šaayušƛa) and Lower Umpqua (Quuiič).","extract_html":"<p><b>Siuslaw</b> was the language of the Siuslaw people and Lower Umpqua (Kuitsh) people of Oregon. It is also known as <i>Lower Umpqua</i>. The Siuslaw language had two dialects: Siuslaw proper (Šaayušƛa) and Lower Umpqua (Quuiič).</p>"}